{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6d7619e20a87b1a9","name":"Droid Commander Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-6d7619e20a87b1a9","title":"Droid Commander Talent Tree","revision":19881,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:47:15Z","sha256":"0e944855a1b9f211c1fef18e2b7e8c1f81df0331b647ae66a2fb87dfb4ee1ae4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19881","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Droid%20Commander%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6d7619e20a87b1a9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have learned the quirks and intricacies of commanding ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", and you can get the most out of even the least sophisticated basic programming.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Automated Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can make a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Tactics)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Tactics)"}," check. If successful, all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," allies able to hear and understand you gain the benefits of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Attack","referenceId":"reference:73f4a3f279861109"}," feat for one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"}," with which you are proficient until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Droid Defense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can transmit tactical information to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," allies that can hear and understand you, granting them a bonus equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," modifier to one of their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," (your choice) until the beginning of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Droid Mettle"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn, you can designate a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". That ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," ally gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to 10 + your Class Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Expanded Sensors"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["If you or any of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," allies has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to, and is aware of, a target, all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," allies that can hear and understand you are also considered to have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," (but not necessarily ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Effect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Effect"},") to that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Inspire Competence"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Expanded Sensors"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn, you can grant one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," a competence bonus on its next attack roll made before the start of your next turn equal to half your Class Level. Additionally, any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," designated as the target of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Network Mind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Network_Mind?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Class Feature is considered to have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heuristic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heuristic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:0c5e1a481742e09b"}," whenever it is beneficial, even if it does not actually have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heuristic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heuristic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:0c5e1a481742e09b"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Maintain Focus"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn, you can grant all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," allies within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," the ability to take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Recover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Recover","referenceId":"reference:0c5327fd45c72552"}," Action as two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," (instead of as three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"},") until the start of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Overclocked Troops"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You push the limits of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," under your command. You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," once per turn to allow each of your Networked allies (see the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Network Mind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Network_Mind?action=edit&redlink=1"}," Class Feature) to immediately ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Reinforce Commands"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Defense"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you use an ability that grants a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," ally a morale or insight bonus, increase the value of that bonus by 1.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
